# Dakboard stack - set in Portainer UI per-stack (never commit real values)
# Also requires DOCKER_DATA_HOME and DOCKER_SHARED_HOME set in Portainer UI

# The board has no secrets in the environment. The Google OAuth refresh
# token and the iCal URL are entered in the settings page at /settings and
# stored in ${DOCKER_DATA_HOME}/dakboard/data/config.json with 0600 perms.

# Nothing else is required.
